# BridgeClip
#
# BridgeClip needs no environment variables to run. It has no account and no
# server: provider keys are entered in the app (Settings, or the setup card on
# first launch) and stored on this machine, encrypted with the OS keychain.
#
# Providers:
#   OpenCode Go - Muse Spark Contributor clip planning (Responses API)
#   Parakeet-local (faster-whisper) - offline transcription, no key needed
#
# Optional overrides (no OpenRouter):
# OPENCODE_API_KEY=muse-key-here
# OPENCODE_BASE_URL=https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1
# BRIDGECLIP_LOCAL_STT_MODEL=small

